OL,3,GNEWSA'My abuser could be released early
OL,4,A- it's sheer terror'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said in a
OL,7,Fstatement: "Release from prison does
OL,8,Fnot mean freedom, and we have designed
OL,9,Fthe toughest licence conditions yet
OL,10,Fwith victim safety at the centre."
